      "sourceNote": "Original ANI nursing synthesis. WHO and DSM support the classification-aware identity, characteristic pattern, impairment, and differential boundaries. APA and MedlinePlus support accessible personality-disorder assessment, psychotherapy, and patient teaching. VA/DoD supports urgent reassessment when a first or sustained psychotic syndrome appears and prevents silent import of schizophrenia treatment into a personality diagnosis. NICE NG10 and SAFE-T support individualized de-escalation, least-restrictive care, suicide inquiry, safety planning, and documentation. No source is used to infer violence or inevitable progression.",
