      "sourceNote": "Original ANI nursing synthesis. NICE provides explicit, bounded observation definitions, therapeutic engagement, least-intrusive use, documentation, staff relief, and review; the card labels those intervals as NICE-specific rather than universal. Joint Commission supports written monitoring and reassessment policies, environmental mitigation, continuous monitoring for high suicide risk when indicated, and safe transitions. VA/DoD supports dynamic suicide-risk assessment and matched intervention.",
