      "sourceNote": "Original ANI nursing synthesis. 42 CFR 482.13 supplies the controlling U.S. federal hospital definition, immediate-safety and least-restrictive requirements, order and face-to-face rules, age-bounded renewal maxima, monitoring, documentation and discontinuation duties. CMS and APA support last-resort use and complication awareness. NICE provides clearly labeled non-U.S. de-escalation, observation, seclusion and debrief guidance. SAMHSA supports trauma-informed prevention and recovery.",
