      "sourceNote": "Original ANI nursing synthesis; no proprietary question wording is reproduced. Columbia supports the protocol's ideation, behavior, preparation, recency and response-based structure. VA/DoD suggests validated measures including the C-SSRS Screener while requiring broader assessment and clinical judgment. SAFE-T and Joint Commission support direct inquiry, documented risk rationale, comprehensive assessment after a positive screen, environmental mitigation, monitoring and follow-up.",
