      "sourceNote": "Original ANI nursing synthesis. WHO and DSM support diagnostic identity, repetitive behaviors, insight, muscle-dysmorphia and eating-disorder boundaries, and differential. NICE supports suicide assessment, BDD-specific CBT/ERP, severity-based care, off-label fluoxetine as the representative generic, pediatric specialist limits, and poor-response referral. DailyMed supports fluoxetine safety, not a BDD indication.",
