      "sourceNote": "Original ANI nursing synthesis. DSM-5-TR supports the OSFED identity and specified examples; ICD-11 is kept distinct. NICE supports treating the presentation according to the closest eating disorder and avoiding BMI-only triage. APA, AAP, NIMH, and refeeding authorities support full medical and psychiatric risk assessment. DailyMed boundaries remain diagnosis- and population-specific.",
