      "sourceNote": "Original ANI nursing synthesis. DSM-5-TR supports the diagnostic frame and boundary; ASAM supports the timing, risk assessment, monitoring, level-of-care, benzodiazepine, adjunct, thiamine, and safety limits; NIAAA supports the direct learner explanation and the bridge from withdrawal management to alcohol use disorder treatment. No commercial-reference prose was copied.",
